Scenario 2 - Printer --> Queue, because FIFO
Scenario 3 - Browser back button --> Github should appear first and it resembles Stack,
Scenario 4 - Customer Service --> Queue
Scenario 5 - Plates --> Stack because the first one eventually gets stacked to the bottom.


