Part 17 -- Compare the ADTs
| Feature            | Stack           | Queue            |
| ------------------ | --------------- | ---------------- |
| Rule               | LIFO            | FIFO             |
| Add operation      | push()          | enqueue()        |
| Remove operation   | pop()           | dequeue()        |
| View next item     | peek()          | peek()           |
| First item removed | Last item added | First item added |


Part 18 -- Connect the ADT to the Implementation
Q18. If you implement a Stack using an array, which part is the ADT?
Building a Stack.

Q19. Which part is the implementation?
The code and array used to store the values.

Q20. If you replace the array with a linked list but keep the same Stack operations, did the ADT change? Explain.
No, because stack operations are the same, only implementation was changed.




